sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as 客户端
    participant Entry as Entrypoint 路由
    participant VE as Vision Encoder
    participant Storage as 3FS 共享存储
    participant Prefill as Prefill 集群 (EP4)
    participant Decode as Decode 超节点 (EP64)

    Client->>Entry: 提交多模态图文 Prompt
    Entry->>VE: 抽取并编码图像
    VE-->>Prefill: 传输视觉特征 Embedding
    Entry->>Prefill: 发送文本 Token 序列
    Note over Prefill: 8卡节点计算前 20 层 Encoder 隐状态
    Prefill->>Storage: 写入初始 SWA 状态与 890B 块状 KV
    Entry->>Decode: 调度请求进入 Decode 队列
    Storage->>Decode: GDR 直通零拷贝换入初始 KV Cache
    loop 逐 Token 自回归生成
        Note over Decode: 64卡超节点 Wide-EP + DSpark 变长验证
        Decode-->>Entry: 流式推送生成的 Token
        Entry-->>Client: 客户端接收响应
    end
